{"unit_id": "tag:01M1:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>模（modules）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。\n由《模（Modules）》中的引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>，对称（symmetric）代数（algebra）<MATH_0004>（由<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上构成）是<MATH_0007>代数（algebras）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。\n因此，可以对它取相对谱（relative spectrum）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "symmetric", "target_term": "对称"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定的底概形"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定层所对应的模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "作为模层的拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所引引理所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "所引结果的类别"}, {"source_term": "symmetric", "target_term": "对称", "context": "限定代数为对称代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "由给定模层在结构层上构成的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所得层中的代数结构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "作为代数层的拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱", "context": "对所得代数层施行的构造"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01M2:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>模（module）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>读者或许预期这里会有<MATH_0004>是有限局部自由（finite locally free）的这一条件。为与<REF_0001>一致，我们没有加上这个条件。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>与<MATH_0005>关联的向量丛（vector bundle associated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是\n<MATH_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "vector bundle associated", "target_term": "关联的向量丛"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "向量丛构造的底"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定给定模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "向量丛构造所取的模"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "脚注中提到的条件"}, {"source_term": "vector bundle associated", "target_term": "关联的向量丛", "context": "由给定模关联得到的向量丛"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01M1:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n与<MATH_0001>关联的向量丛（vector bundle associated）还带有一些额外的结构。具体地说，我们有一个分次（grading）\n<MATH_0002>\n它使<MATH_0003>成为分次（graded）<MATH_0004>代数（algebra）。反过来，<MATH_0005>可由其中次数（degree）为<MATH_0006>的部分恢复。\n因此，我们如下定义抽象向量丛（abstract vector bundle）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "vector bundle associated", "target_term": "关联的向量丛"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "abstract vector bundle", "target_term": "抽象向量丛"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "vector bundle associated", "target_term": "关联的向量丛", "context": "从给定模得到的向量丛"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次", "context": "赋予代数的额外结构"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定所得代数的结构"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "带有该分次的对象"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "用于指定恢复所取的部分"}, {"source_term": "abstract vector bundle", "target_term": "抽象向量丛", "context": "下文将要给出定义的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:062M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>向量丛（vector bundle）<MATH_0002>（在<MATH_0003>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的仿射（affine）态射（morphism），其中<MATH_0004>带有如下分次（graded）<MATH_0005>代数（algebra）结构\n<MATH_0006>\n并满足<MATH_0007>，且映射（maps）\n<MATH_0008>\n对所有<MATH_0009>均为同构（isomorphisms）。<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0010>上的向量丛态射（morphism of vector bundles）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>，使得诱导映射（induced map）\n<MATH_0012>\n与给定的分次（gradings）相容。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "vector bundle", "target_term": "向量丛"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "morphism of vector bundles", "target_term": "向量丛态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "gradings", "target_term": "分次"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "向量丛定义所给定的底"}, {"source_term": "vector bundle", "target_term": "向量丛", "context": "本段定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "仿射态射两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "限定态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "作为向量丛的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定代数结构"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "定义所要求的代数结构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "定义中要求为同构的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "对所有指定指标要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism of vector bundles", "target_term": "向量丛态射", "context": "给定底上的向量丛之间的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "须满足分次相容性的态射"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射", "context": "由该态射诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "gradings", "target_term": "分次", "context": "诱导映射须与之相容的给定分次"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01M1:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<MATH_0001>上的向量丛（vector bundle）的一个例子是仿射（affine）<MATH_0002>空间（space）<MATH_0003>（底为<MATH_0004>），见定义（Definition）<REF_0001>。\n这是因为\n<MATH_0005>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "vector bundle", "target_term": "向量丛"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "Definition", "target_term": "定义"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "vector bundle", "target_term": "向量丛", "context": "例子所属的对象类别"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "限定所举空间的类型"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "用作向量丛例子的空间"}, {"source_term": "Definition", "target_term": "定义", "context": "所引结果的类别"}], "notes": []}
